{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06625","headline":"刘先生闲居 · 储光羲","name":"刘先生闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高第後归道，乃居玉华宫。\n逍遥人间世，不异浮丘公。\n甘寝何秉羽，出门忽从戎。\n方将游崑仑，又欲小崆峒。\n进退既在我，归来长安中。\n焚香东海君，侍坐西山童。\n善行无辙迹，吾亦安能穷。\n但见神色闲，中心如虚空。\n期之比天老，真德辅帝鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}